course: dictionary
lesson: 16079
title: Wallop: a hard hit, or a hard beating
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Wallop is a bouncy, noisy word, and it can be a verb or a noun. As a verb, to wallop means to hit something or someone very hard. «The ball walloped the window and bounced back.» The loud crash tells you wallop means a very hard hit.
explain: Wallop can also be a noun: a wallop is a hard hit, or the loud thump of a heavy thing falling. «The tin hit the floor with a wallop.» The clues are the loud, heavy fall, so the noun means a big, noisy thud.
explain: In sport, wallop means to beat a team by a lot. «Our team walloped the other school 6–0.» The score shows that walloped means won easily, not hit with a hand or a ball.
fact: Wallop means to hit something very hard.
fact: A wallop is a hard hit, or a loud, heavy thump.
fact: In sport, «walloped» means beaten by a big margin, as in «walloped 6–0».
fact: «Pack a wallop» means to be very powerful or strong, as in «This lemon juice packs a wallop!»
fact: Wallop is informal and old-fashioned slang for beer in the UK, and it is often used as a joke. Hitting a person is never OK, so use wallop about sport, sounds and strong things, not about people.
exercise: «The ball gave the wall a wallop and bounced back.» What does wallop mean here? | A soft, gentle stroke | A sleepy yawn | A tiny whisper | *A hard hit, with a loud thud
exercise: «Our team got walloped 6–0 in the final.» What does walloped mean? | Given a prize | Left at home | *Beaten by a lot | Hugged warmly
exercise: «The storm walloped the coast all night.» Find and copy the word that means hit very hard. | *walloped | night | storm | coast
test: «This lemon juice packs a wallop.» What does packs a wallop mean? | Is very slow to drink | Is cold and icy | *Is very powerful and strong | Is made for babies
test: In the comic, the sound said «wallop» when the box fell. What is a wallop here? | A quiet song | *A loud, heavy thump | A type of bird | A kind of cake
exam: Sam says walloping his little brother is funny. What is the best answer? | *It is not OK, because hitting people hurts them | It is funny, so Sam should do it | It only means beating someone in a game, so it is fine | It means hugging someone tightly
